      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Quiz is a psychological horror experience that explores themes of
    mobile security, data awareness, and personal privacy.\n\nThis game contains
    simulated phishing, social engineering scenarios, and deliberately invasive content
    designed for educational purposes.\n\nYour quiz scores will be submitted to a
    public leaderboard. While names are anonymized, high scores are stored and displayed
    globally.\n\nThe game may access your device's IP address to simulate real-world
    data awareness. This is used for gameplay immersion and is not stored beyond
    the session.\n\nNo real personal data is collected or transmitted externally\u2014aside
    from your score and approximate location.\n\nBy continuing, you acknowledge this
    experience may challenge your comfort, perception, and awareness.\n\nThis is
    not a real security audit. This is a simulation.\n\nProceed with caution.\n\nThis
    game contains flickering lights, sudden visual distortions, and visual effects
    that may trigger seizures for players with photosensitive epilepsy.\n\nViewer
    discretion is advised.\n\nSome screens may simulate access to personal information.
    These are narrative illusions not actual intrusions.\n\nYour device remains under
    your control. Until it doesn\u2019t."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
